[L:127] +│   └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘   │
[L:128] +│                                                                             │
[L:129] +└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
[L:130] +```
[L:131] +
[L:132] +### 2.2 Service Boundaries
[L:133] +
[L:134] +| Service | Runtime | Responsibility |
[L:135] +|---------|---------|---------------|
[L:136] +| `web` | React + Vite | Command center dashboard, configuration, monitoring, alerts, decision log, performance analytics |
[L:137] +| `api` | Node.js + Fastify | Auth, RBAC, configuration persistence, state management, alert dispatch, manual overrides |
[L:138] +| `scheduler` | Node.js + BullMQ | Cron jobs, queue management, pipeline triggers, state machine transitions |
[L:139] +| `orchestrator` | Node.js + Fastify | Autonomous decision pipeline, engine registry, state machine, watchdog |
[L:140] +| `ws` | Node.js + ws | Real-time push: decisions, fills, position updates, alerts, system health |
[L:141] +| `ingest` | Node.js worker | EODHD REST polling, WebSocket streaming, normalization, quality checks |
[L:142] +| `ml` | Node.js/ONNX | Feature engineering, model inference, drift detection |
[L:143] +
[L:144] +### 2.3 The State Machine
[L:145] +
[L:146] +The autonomous system operates as a state machine:
[L:147] +
[L:148] +```
[L:149] +                    ┌─────────────┐
[L:150] +                    │   OFFLINE   │
[L:151] +                    └──────┬──────┘
[L:152] +                           │ User starts system
[L:153] +                           ▼
[L:154] +                    ┌─────────────┐
[L:155] +                    │   IDLE      │
[L:156] +                    │  (waiting   │
[L:157] +                    │   for data) │
[L:158] +                    └──────┬──────┘
[L:159] +                           │ Data received
[L:160] +                           ▼
[L:161] +                    ┌─────────────┐
[L:162] +                    │  MONITORING │
[L:163] +                    │  (engines   │
[L:164] +                    │   running)  │
[L:165] +                    └──────┬──────┘
[L:166] +                           │ Decision generated
[L:167] +                           ▼
[L:168] +              ┌────────────────────────┐
