[L:921] +## 7. Circuit Breakers (Automatic Safety)
[L:922] +
[L:923] +### 7.1 Circuit Breaker Types
[L:924] +
[L:925] +| Breaker | Trigger | Action | Recovery |
[L:926] +|---------|---------|--------|----------|
[L:927] +| **Daily Loss Limit** | Realized losses reach 3% of account | Halt all new trades for 24h | Automatic at 00:00 UTC next day |
[L:928] +| **Consecutive Losses** | 3 losses in a row | Pause 4h, force trade review | Manual resume after review |
[L:929] +| **Drawdown Limit** | 10% drawdown from peak | Pause, require manual review | Manual resume after risk profile review |
[L:930] +| **Volatility Spike** | ATR doubles in 4h | Reduce position sizes 50% | Automatic when ATR normalizes |
[L:931] +| **Data Failure** | No fresh data for 5 minutes | Suspend all decisions | Automatic when data resumes |
[L:932] +| **Model Drift** | ML accuracy < 55% over 50 trades | Reduce ML weight to 0, alert | Manual retrain and redeploy |
[L:933] +| **Queue Backup** | > 100 jobs queued for > 10 minutes | Pause new decisions, alert | Automatic when queue clears |
[L:934] +| **API Failure** | EODHD down for > 15 minutes | Switch to backup provider (Binance) | Automatic when primary resumes |
[L:935] +| **SL Cluster** | Multiple positions hit SL in 1h | Pause 2h, review correlation | Manual resume |
[L:936] +
