[L:1] +# Quantum --- Complete Project Description
[L:2] +
[L:3] +## 1. Project Overview
[L:4] +
[L:5] +**Quantum** is an AI-assisted trading intelligence and paper-trading
[L:6] +platform designed to analyze financial markets, combine multiple forms
[L:7] +of technical and quantitative evidence, generate explainable trade
[L:8] +decisions, test strategies against historical data, manage paper
[L:9] +positions, monitor portfolio risk, and provide research/learning tools.
[L:10] +
[L:11] +The uploaded project is primarily a **React + TypeScript + Vite frontend
[L:12] +application** with a **Supabase backend/data layer and Supabase Edge
[L:13] +Functions**. It also contains an **in-browser TensorFlow.js
[L:14] +machine-learning system** and a large collection of modular
[L:15] +trading-analysis engines.
[L:16] +
[L:17] +> **Important implementation note:** The current codebase is not a
[L:18] +> Python/FastAPI application. Its ML service is implemented as a
[L:19] +> Supabase/Deno TypeScript Edge Function, while additional ML
[L:20] +> training/inference code runs through TensorFlow.js in the application.
[L:21] +
[L:22] +------------------------------------------------------------------------
[L:23] +
