[L:902] +explainabilityEngine.ts
[L:903] +ExplanationPanel.tsx
[L:904] +```
[L:905] +
[L:906] +The objective is to explain why a trade decision was generated.
[L:907] +
[L:908] +An explanation can be built around:
[L:909] +
[L:910] +-   Evidence
[L:911] +-   Market context
[L:912] +-   Strategy
[L:913] +-   Risk
[L:914] +-   Contradictions
