[L:1041] +
[L:1042] +# 31. Portfolio Engine
[L:1043] +
[L:1044] +The portfolio engine evaluates the trading decision against the current
[L:1045] +portfolio.
[L:1046] +
[L:1047] +It can consider:
[L:1048] +
[L:1049] +-   Existing positions
[L:1050] +-   Portfolio risk
[L:1051] +-   Exposure
[L:1052] +-   Position sizing
[L:1053] +-   Correlations
[L:1054] +-   Portfolio constraints
[L:1055] +
[L:1056] +This is important because a good individual trade can still be a poor
[L:1057] +portfolio-level decision.
[L:1058] +
[L:1059] +------------------------------------------------------------------------
