[L:1083] +For example:
[L:1084] +
[L:1085] +``` text
[L:1086] +Asset A
[L:1087] +   ↕
[L:1088] +Correlation
[L:1089] +   ↕
[L:1090] +Asset B
[L:1091] +```
[L:1092] +
[L:1093] +This can help avoid excessive correlated exposure.
