[L:1378] +# 46. Production Data Architecture Recommendation
[L:1379] +
[L:1380] +For the intended production Quantum architecture, market data should
[L:1381] +be abstracted.
[L:1382] +
[L:1383] +Recommended design:
[L:1384] +
[L:1385] +``` text
[L:1386] +                    Market Data Interface
[L:1387] +                            │
[L:1388] +             ┌──────────────┼──────────────┐
[L:1389] +             │              │              │
[L:1390] +          EODHD          Binance        Future API
[L:1391] +        Primary          Crypto          Provider
[L:1392] +```
[L:1393] +
[L:1394] +The engines should consume normalized candles rather than directly
[L:1395] +calling a provider.
[L:1396] +
[L:1397] +``` text
[L:1398] +Provider
[L:1399] +   ↓
[L:1400] +Normalizer
[L:1401] +   ↓
[L:1402] +Market Data Service
[L:1403] +   ↓
[L:1404] +Cache
[L:1405] +   ↓
[L:1406] +Trading Engines
[L:1407] +```
[L:1408] +
[L:1409] +------------------------------------------------------------------------
[L:1410] +
