[L:1412] +
[L:1413] +For real-time market intelligence:
[L:1414] +
[L:1415] +``` text
[L:1416] +Market Provider
[L:1417] +      ↓
[L:1418] +WebSocket / Streaming Layer
[L:1419] +      ↓
[L:1420] +Market Data Normalizer
[L:1421] +      ↓
[L:1422] +Redis / Fast Cache
[L:1423] +      ↓
[L:1424] +Feature Calculation
[L:1425] +      ↓
[L:1426] +Analysis Engines
[L:1427] +      ↓
[L:1428] +Master Decision Engine
[L:1429] +      ↓
[L:1430] +Alert System
[L:1431] +      ↓
[L:1432] +Frontend
[L:1433] +```
[L:1434] +
[L:1435] +The uploaded project contains the analytical engines required for much
[L:1436] +of this pipeline, but a fully production-grade real-time streaming layer
[L:1437] +would need to be implemented around the provider integration.
