[L:1561] +
[L:1562] +# 51. Trading Intelligence Philosophy
[L:1563] +
[L:1564] +Quantum is designed around **confluence rather than one-indicator
[L:1565] +trading**.
[L:1566] +
[L:1567] +Instead of:
[L:1568] +
[L:1569] +``` text
[L:1570] +RSI < 30
[L:1571] +    ↓
[L:1572] +BUY
[L:1573] +```
[L:1574] +
[L:1575] +the system attempts to reason:
[L:1576] +
[L:1577] +``` text
[L:1578] +Data Quality
[L:1579] ++
[L:1580] +Market Structure
[L:1581] ++
[L:1582] +Liquidity
[L:1583] ++
[L:1584] +Patterns
[L:1585] ++
[L:1586] +Indicators
[L:1587] ++
[L:1588] +Regime
[L:1589] ++
[L:1590] +Strategy
[L:1591] ++
[L:1592] +Historical Similarity
[L:1593] ++
[L:1594] +ML
[L:1595] ++
[L:1596] +Risk
[L:1597] ++
[L:1598] +Portfolio
[L:1599] +=
[L:1600] +Decision
[L:1601] +```
[L:1602] +
[L:1603] +This is one of the core architectural ideas of the project.
[L:1604] +
