[L:482] +## 9. Risk Architecture — The Sacred Layer
[L:483] +
[L:484] +### 9.1 Risk Profiles
[L:485] +
[L:486] +Every user has a risk profile:
[L:487] +- **Conservative**: 1% risk per trade, max 3% daily loss, max 3 open positions
[L:488] +- **Moderate**: 1.5% risk per trade, max 4% daily loss, max 4 open positions
[L:489] +- **Aggressive**: 2% risk per trade, max 5% daily loss, max 5 open positions
[L:490] +- **Custom**: User-defined, but hard limits apply (max 2% per trade, max 6% heat)
[L:491] +
[L:492] +### 9.2 The Risk Dashboard
[L:493] +
[L:494] +```
[L:495] +┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐
[L:496] +│  RISK DASHBOARD                         │
[L:497] +├─────────────────────────────────────────┤
[L:498] +│                                         │
[L:499] +│  Portfolio Heat: [████░░░░░░] 4.2/6%   │
[L:500] +│  Daily P&L:     [██░░░░░░░░] +1.2%     │
[L:501] +│  Daily Loss Left:[████████░░] -1.8%     │
[L:502] +│  Open Positions: 3/5                    │
[L:503] +│  Correlated:     2 (EUR/USD, GBP/USD)   │
[L:504] +│  Consecutive Losses: 0                  │
[L:505] +│  Current Drawdown: 2.1% from peak       │
[L:506] +│                                         │
[L:507] +│  [Circuit Breaker Status: ACTIVE]       │
[L:508] +│  [Session: NY Open — Kill Zone]         │
[L:509] +│                                         │
[L:510] +└─────────────────────────────────────────┘
[L:511] +```
[L:512] +
[L:513] +### 9.3 Circuit Breakers
[L:514] +
[L:515] +1. **Daily Loss Limit**: Hit 3% loss in a day → system stops trading for 24 hours
[L:516] +2. **Consecutive Losses**: 3 losses in a row → system pauses for 4 hours, forces trade review
[L:517] +3. **Drawdown Limit**: 10% drawdown from peak → system pauses, requires manual review and risk profile adjustment
[L:518] +4. **Volatility Spike**: ATR doubles in 4 hours → system reduces position sizes by 50%
[L:519] +5. **Data Failure**: No fresh data for 5 minutes → system suspends all decisions
[L:520] +6. **Model Drift**: ML prediction accuracy drops below 55% over last 50 trades → ML evidence weight reduced to 0
[L:521] +
[L:522] +### 9.4 The Risk Journal
[L:523] +
[L:524] +Every risk event is logged:
[L:525] +- "Trade #1245 rejected: portfolio heat would exceed 6%"
[L:526] +- "Circuit breaker triggered: 3 consecutive losses, system paused 4h"
[L:527] +- "Position size reduced 20%: ATR elevated, volatility spike detected"
[L:528] +- "Daily loss limit reached: -3.1%, trading suspended until tomorrow 00:00 UTC"
[L:529] +
[L:530] +The user can review this journal to understand *why* the system said no.
