[L:284] +
[L:285] +### Consumer Groups
[L:286] +- `analysis-consumers` — One group per engine. Parallel processing.
[L:287] +- `decision-consumer` — Single consumer (decisions must be sequential per symbol).
[L:288] +- `paper-trading-consumer` — Executes orders, manages positions.
[L:289] +- `web-socket-consumer` — Pushes events to connected frontend clients.
[L:290] +- `persistence-consumer` — Writes events to TimescaleDB/PostgreSQL.
