[L:1482] +
[L:1483] +## 21. Anti-Patterns (Non-Negotiable)
[L:1484] +
[L:1485] +1. **No Look-Ahead Bias** — Architecturally enforced via candle slicing and feature store point-in-time retrieval.
[L:1486] +2. **No Training in Browser** — ML training is server-side only. Browser inference is pre-trained models only.
[L:1487] +3. **No Hardcoded Secrets** — Environment variables only. Frontend never sees API keys.
[L:1488] +4. **No Direct API Calls from Engines** — All market data via `MarketDataProvider` abstraction.
[L:1489] +5. **No Unvalidated Backtests** — Every backtest must pass automated look-ahead bias detection.
[L:1490] +6. **No Black-Box Decisions** — Every decision has a mandatory explanation field.
[L:1491] +7. **No Ignoring Contradictions** — Conflicting evidence reduces confidence and is surfaced to the user.
[L:1492] +8. **No Risk as Afterthought** — Risk engine has veto power. Period.
[L:1493] +9. **No Overfitting** — Optimize on in-sample, validate on out-of-sample. Walk-forward required.
[L:1494] +10. **No Scope Creep in MVP** — 7 pages, 3 engines, 1 symbol class. Everything else is Phase 7.
[L:1495] +
