[L:10] +## 1. System Architecture
[L:11] +
[L:12] +### 1.1 High-Level Design
[L:13] +
[L:14] +Quantum is a **distributed full-stack trading intelligence platform** with a clear separation between presentation, orchestration, intelligence, and data.
