[L:501] +
[L:502] +### 4.3 Chart Drawing System
[L:503] +
[L:504] +**Drawing Layer Architecture:**
[L:505] +- **Layer 0**: Lightweight Charts renders candlesticks, volume, grid, crosshair
[L:506] +- **Layer 1 (Canvas Overlay)**: Custom HTML5 Canvas element absolutely positioned over Layer 0. Draws all annotations.
[L:507] +- **Layer 2 (HTML Overlay)**: DOM elements for tooltips, labels, and interactive buttons on drawings
[L:508] +- **Synchronization**: Canvas overlay must precisely match Lightweight Charts coordinate system via the chart's `timeToCoordinate()` and `coordinateToPrice()` APIs
[L:509] +
[L:510] +**Drawing Types & Visual Properties:**
[L:511] +
[L:512] +| Drawing | Type | Color | Opacity | Line Style | Interactive |
[L:513] +|---------|------|-------|---------|------------|-------------|
[L:514] +| Trend Line | Line | #3b82f6 (blue) | 100% | Solid, 2px | Hover: highlight, show swing points |
[L:515] +| BOS Marker | Marker | #22c55e (green up) / #ef4444 (red down) | 100% | Arrow, 16px | Click: scroll to BOS candle, show context |
[L:516] +| MSS Marker | Marker | #eab308 (yellow) | 100% | Warning triangle, 16px | Click: show shift details |
[L:517] +| Order Block | Zone | #f97316 (orange) | 50% fill | Rectangle, 1px border | Hover: show OB details, mitigation status |
[L:518] +| Mitigated OB | Zone | #f97316 (orange) | 15% fill | Dashed border | Hover: show mitigation timestamp |
[L:519] +| Breaker Block | Zone | #a855f7 (purple) | 50% fill | Rectangle, 1px border | Hover: show original OB details |
[L:520] +| FVG | Zone | #06b6d4 (cyan) | 30% fill | Rectangle, no border | Hover: show fill status, displacement context |
[L:521] +| Liquidity Pool | Line | #ef4444 (red) | 100% | Dashed, 1px | Hover: show pool type (equal highs, session high, etc.) |
[L:522] +| Liquidity Sweep | Marker | #ef4444 (red) | 100% | X marker, 12px | Click: show sweep candle, displacement after |
[L:523] +| Entry Zone | Zone | #22c55e (green) | 25% fill | Rectangle, 2px solid border | Hover: show entry rationale, strategy name |
[L:524] +| Stop Loss | Line | #ef4444 (red) | 100% | Solid, 2px | Hover: show risk amount, distance in pips, ATR multiple |
[L:525] +| Target 1 (1:2) | Line | #22c55e (green) | 100% | Dashed, 1.5px | Hover: show R:R, probability if available |
[L:526] +| Target 2 (1:3) | Line | #22c55e (green) | 100% | Dashed, 1.5px | Hover: show R:R |
[L:527] +| Target 3 (1:4) | Line | #22c55e (green) | 100% | Dashed, 1.5px | Hover: show R:R |
[L:528] +| Session Marker | Line | #6b7280 (grey) | 40% | Vertical line, 1px | Hover: show session name, open/close time |
[L:529] +| Kill Zone | Background | #22c55e (green) | 5% | Full height vertical band | Label at top: "London Kill Zone" |
[L:530] +| Position Line | Line | Dynamic (green if profit, red if loss) | 100% | Solid, 2px, label with P&L | Hover: show position details, entry time, current R:R |
[L:531] +| Inducement | Line | #f59e0b (amber) | 60% | Dotted, 1px | Hover: show inducement target |
