[L:721] +## 5. Role-Based Access Control (RBAC)
[L:722] +
[L:723] +### 5.1 Role Hierarchy
[L:724] +
[L:725] +```
[L:726] +Super Admin
[L:727] +    └── Admin
[L:728] +            └── User (Trader)
[L:729] +```
[L:730] +
[L:731] +### 5.2 Permission Matrix
[L:732] +
[L:733] +| Resource | Action | User | Admin | Super Admin |
[L:734] +|----------|--------|------|-------|-------------|
[L:735] +| **Own Profile** | Read/Write | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
[L:736] +| **Own Risk Profile** | Read/Write | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
[L:737] +| **Own Decisions** | Read | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
[L:738] +| **Own Positions** | Read/Write | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
[L:739] +| **Own Trades** | Read | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
[L:740] +| **Own Backtests** | Read/Write | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
[L:741] +| **Own Journal** | Read/Write | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
[L:742] +| **Own Settings** | Read/Write | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
[L:743] +| **Other Users' Data** | Read | ❌ | ✅ (read-only) | ✅ |
[L:744] +| **Other Users' Trades** | Read | ❌ | ✅ (read-only) | ✅ |
[L:745] +| **User Management** | List/View | ❌ | ✅ | ✅ |
[L:746] +| **User Roles** | Assign user/admin | ❌ | ✅ | ✅ |
[L:747] +| **User Roles** | Assign super_admin | ❌ | ❌ | ✅ |
[L:748] +| **Strategies** | Create (personal) | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
[L:749] +| **Strategies** | Approve/validate | ❌ | ✅ | ✅ |
[L:750] +| **Strategies** | System-wide edit | ❌ | ❌ | ✅ |
[L:751] +| **Models** | View status | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
[L:752] +| **Models** | Deploy/rollback | ❌ | ✅ | ✅ |
[L:753] +| **Models** | Train new (personal) | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
[L:754] +| **Models** | System-wide train | ❌ | ❌ | ✅ |
[L:755] +| **System Analytics** | View | ❌ | ✅ | ✅ |
[L:756] +| **Audit Logs** | View own | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
[L:757] +| **Audit Logs** | View all | ❌ | ✅ | ✅ |
[L:758] +| **System Health** | View | ❌ | ✅ | ✅ |
[L:759] +| **Circuit Breaker** | Trigger own | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
