[L:1046] +
[L:1047] +## 7. Security Model
[L:1048] +
[L:1049] +### 7.1 Authentication
[L:1050] +- Supabase Auth with email/password
[L:1051] +- JWT access tokens (15-minute expiry)
[L:1052] +- Refresh tokens (7-day expiry, stored in httpOnly cookie)
[L:1053] +- Password requirements: min 12 chars, 1 uppercase, 1 number, 1 symbol
[L:1054] +- Account lockout after 5 failed attempts (15-minute cooldown)
[L:1055] +
[L:1056] +### 7.2 Authorization
[L:1057] +- RBAC with three roles: user, admin, super_admin
[L:1058] +- RLS on all PostgreSQL tables
[L:1059] +- API layer validates role on every protected endpoint
[L:1060] +- Frontend route guards prevent UI access to unauthorized routes
[L:1061] +- Admin actions are audited (who did what, when, why)
[L:1062] +
[L:1063] +### 7.3 Secrets Management
[L:1064] +- All API keys in environment variables
[L:1065] +- Frontend never sees provider API keys (EODHD, Binance, etc.)
[L:1066] +- `.env.example` only — real `.env` in `.gitignore`
[L:1067] +- Secret rotation via super admin panel (updates env, restarts services)
[L:1068] +- Database credentials only in API/ingest/ML services
[L:1069] +
[L:1070] +### 7.4 Input Validation
[L:1071] +- Zod schemas on all API inputs
[L:1072] +- SQL injection prevention via Prisma (parameterized queries)
[L:1073] +- XSS prevention via React escaping + Content Security Policy
[L:1074] +- Rate limiting: 100 requests/minute per user, 10 requests/minute per IP for auth endpoints
[L:1075] +
[L:1076] +### 7.5 Audit Logging
[L:1077] +Every sensitive action is logged:
[L:1078] +- Login/logout
[L:1079] +- Role changes
[L:1080] +- Strategy approvals
[L:1081] +- Model deployments
[L:1082] +- Circuit breaker triggers
[L:1083] +- Secret rotations
[L:1084] +- Paper trade executions
[L:1085] +- Risk gate vetoes
[L:1086] +
[L:1087] +```sql
[L:1088] +CREATE TABLE audit_logs (
[L:1089] +  id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),
[L:1090] +  actor_id UUID REFERENCES auth.users(id),
[L:1091] +  actor_email TEXT,
[L:1092] +  action TEXT NOT NULL,
[L:1093] +  resource_type TEXT NOT NULL,
[L:1094] +  resource_id TEXT,
[L:1095] +  before_state JSONB,
[L:1096] +  after_state JSONB,
[L:1097] +  ip_address INET,
[L:1098] +  user_agent TEXT,
[L:1099] +  correlation_id TEXT,
[L:1100] +  created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT NOW()
[L:1101] +);
[L:1102] +```
[L:1103] +
