[L:1121] +
[L:1122] +### 8.2 Production (MVP)
[L:1123] +- **Frontend (web)**: Vercel — automatic deploys from main branch
[L:1124] +- **API (api)**: Railway — Docker deploy, auto-restart, health checks
[L:1125] +- **WebSocket (ws)**: Railway — dedicated service for WS connections
[L:1126] +- **Ingestion (ingest)**: Railway — background worker, auto-restart
[L:1127] +- **ML (ml)**: Railway — CPU-only, training runs overnight
[L:1128] +- **Database**: Supabase PostgreSQL — managed, backups, RLS
[L:1129] +- **Cache**: Upstash Redis — managed, persistence
[L:1130] +- **Monitoring**: Logtail (structured logs) + UptimeRobot (health checks)
[L:1131] +
[L:1132] +### 8.3 Production (Scale)
[L:1133] +- **Frontend**: Vercel Pro with edge caching
[L:1134] +- **API**: Kubernetes (EKS/GKE) with horizontal pod autoscaling
[L:1135] +- **WS**: Kubernetes with sticky sessions (session affinity)
[L:1136] +- **Ingest**: Kubernetes CronJobs + dedicated streaming pods
[L:1137] +- **ML**: Kubernetes with GPU nodes for training
[L:1138] +- **Database**: Managed PostgreSQL (RDS/Cloud SQL) with read replicas
[L:1139] +- **Cache**: Redis Cluster (ElastiCache)
[L:1140] +- **Monitoring**: Datadog or Grafana Cloud (metrics, logs, traces, APM)
[L:1141] +- **CDN**: Cloudflare for static assets
